=== 1. while-read pipeline (bash: counter stays 0)
after pipe: counter=0 (bash expects 0)
=== 2. command substitution captures the count fine
via cmdsubst: counter=5 (bash expects 5)
=== 3. explicit subshell isolates
  inside: inner
after subshell: x=outer (bash expects outer)
=== 4. brace group does NOT isolate
after brace: y=inner (bash expects inner)
=== 5. exit code propagation through pipeline
false|true rc=0  (bash expects 0)
=== 6. set -o pipefail surfaces left-side failure
false|true rc=1  (with pipefail, expects 1)
=== 7. nested pipeline + cmd subst
nested cmdsubst: 4 (bash expects 4)
